/T (In recent years, our world has become increasingly unpredictable and volatile. Climate change is rapidly changing weather patterns, and global crises have put a heavy strain on energy, commercial fertilizer and global supply chains in general. The results of which have trickled down and disproportionately affected the most vulnerable in our communities. )
