/T (Kanthasami Mallikathevi, is a small-scale woman farmer from Kirishnapram, Killinochchi, in the North of Sri Lanka. As a mother of three and the head of a household, she is extremely reliant on access to water and affordable electricity to ensure a bountiful harvest each season. )
/E (Kanthasami Mallikathevi, is a small-scale woman farmer from Kirishnapram, Killinochchi, in the North of Sri Lanka. As a mother of three and the head of a household, she is extremely reliant on access to water and affordable electricity to ensure a bountiful harvest each season. )
